# The repo-wide .gitignore drops *.csv and *.json everywhere. Split manifests in
# THIS directory are source-of-truth artifacts and must be tracked, so re-include
# them. (No parent dir is excluded — only file patterns — so negation is valid.)
!*.csv
!MANIFEST.json
!atom3d_lba_v22clean_audit.json
!.gitignore
# CleanSplit (GEMS) reference inputs + filtering scripts (define clean_ed_* schemes)
!cleansplit_ref/
!cleansplit_ref/*.json
!cleansplit_ref/*.py
!cleansplit_ref/*.md
